<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70;">-</span><span style="--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8;"> 타입은 대략적으로만 작성해도 괜찮습니다.</span></span>
